---
title: Tuna Noodle Casserole
source: Matt
servings: 4
prep time: 20 minutes
cook time: 25 minutes
---

Cook @farfalle pasta{3%cups} according to package directions.

Combine @canned tuna{12%oz}, @cream of celery soup{1%can}, @sour cream{1/2%cup}, @seasoned salt{1%tsp}, @chopped green onion{1/4%cup} and @cheddar cheese{1/4%cup} in a #saucepan{}; heat until warm and melted.

Add the tuna mixture to the pasta and stir to combine.

Pour into a #casserole dish{} and bake at 325 F for ~{25%minutes}.
